<view class="merchant-page"><view class="title">店员管理</view><view class="subtitle">店员可以查单、核销、查看库存；取消订单和发券由店主操作</view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">邀请一位店员</view><view class="muted">让店员先绑定小程序，再在「我的 → 商家授权」输入邀请授权码。30 分钟内有效，仅可使用一次。</view><view wx:if="{{invite}}" class="code" bindtap="copy">{{invite}}</view><view class="primary {{busy ? 'disabled' : ''}}" style="margin-top:24rpx" bindtap="invite">{{invite ? '重新生成授权码' : '生成店员授权码'}}</view><view wx:if="{{invite}}" class="link" bindtap="copy">复制授权码</view></view><view class="section-title">商家成员</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载…</view><view wx:for="{{members}}" wx:key="customer_id" class="card row"><view class="grow">{{item.name}}<view class="muted">{{item.phone}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.role === 'owner' ? '店主' : (item.active ? '店员' : '已停用')}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{item.role === 'staff' && item.active}}" class="danger {{busy ? 'disabled' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.customer_id}}" bindtap="revoke">停用</view></view></view>
